# Brill: The Caravan Office (mod-brill-home, tools/town/caravan.py), ChromieCraft's realm: Brill Endures granted
# (the project's stage 1, <8:1>: the caravan's stages are invisibility kind 8), Quartermaster Irena Sable at her
# field desk on the Undercity road. The Road Isn't Empty (the three stranded drivers, the ruts and two broken
# wagons, the Magistrate, the stakes); A Place to Unload (six dumped crates down the road, Rudd Carver's winch, the
# yard's timber, Abe Winters's iron, the platform and the crates stowed); The Missing Manifest (the wagon and the
# records on the trail, Bartle Kemp's camp, his cargo, Selwyn heard, and the choice: Selwyn exposed, the mark
# q971514); Licenses and Liabilities (the Exchange in the Undercity, the Sepulcher's factor at the Gallows' End,
# Zygand's Deathguard and Bastian, and the first road: the Undercity, the mark q971518); The First Departure (the
# wagon and its crates, the guards, the ambushers, the receipt at the crossroads). Each quest moves the stage on;
# then the office open (<8:6>, Irena behind its counter, the daily offered) and the house's furniture bought from
# her (<8:7>, the mark q971507).
cmd .levelup 11
cmd .modify money 100000
cmd .brilltown grant 971000
# Stage 1: Irena at her field desk by the road.
go 0 2199.5 259.5 36.8
wait 2
cmd .brilltown state
has <8:1>
talk 971500
accept 971500 971500
# The Road Isn't Empty: the drivers stranded on the verge.
go 0 2189.0 228.0 36.3
talk 971506
select 971506 gone wrong on the road
expect credit 971500 971531 1/3
go 0 2197.5 232.5 34.7
talk 971507
select 971507 why you're stuck here
expect credit 971500 971531 2/3
go 0 2205.0 237.0 34.4
talk 971508
select 971508 asking the drivers
expect credit 971500 971531 3/3
# The ruts, and the two broken wagons south of the yard.
